What is derived, and how it was changed:

  data/families/    VERINA tasks (description, signature, specification, reference code, proof,
                    tests) parsed into one JSON file per task, with fields added by this project
                    (regions, eligibility, split, automation coverage).
  data/hidden/      additional tests generated by this project for the VERINA specifications.
  data/instances/   buggy variants of the VERINA reference code, produced by this project's
                    mutation operators or written by language models.
  runs/, results/   model outputs and analyses for those tasks.

The VERINA repository itself is not redistributed here; scripts/setup.sh fetches it at the commit above.
